      "action": "vienna-adult-social.sunday-table/sunday-table.argument",
      "generated": true
    },
    {
      "year": 1992,
      "title": "汤厨房的长队",
      "text": "热水里撒了碱，手背泡得发红。修女把抹布搭在灶沿，说锅底别刮太狠，这锅比她还老。Hermann Winter蹲下去刷，听见门外队伍渐渐散了。",
      "action": "vienna-parish-aid.soup-kitchen/soup-kitchen.help-wash",
      "generated": true
    },
